            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell that is adjacent to a vessel. A perivascular cell plays a crucial role in maintaining vascular function and tissue homeostasis. This cell type regulates vessel integrity and flow dynamics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
