        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A material entity that is a maximal functionally integrated unit that develops from a program encoded in a genome</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">&apos;Maximal functionally integrated unit&apos; is intended to express unity, which Barry considers synonymous with BFO &apos;object&apos;.</obo:IAO_0000116>
