    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECOCORE_00000041">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An evolutionary quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s morphological and physiological adaptation for living in trees</obo:IAO_0000115>
