        <obo:IAO_0000115>A part of an astronomical body which is primarily composed of a continuous volume of gaseous or aerosolised material held in shape by one or more environmental processes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>This may not need to be in the atmosphere, also note that &quot;meteor&quot; will do much of the same work.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">aeroform</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


