        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">A particle which 1) is composed primarily of hydrous aluminium phyllosilicate minerals, in turn composed of aluminium and silicon ions bonded into tiny, thin plates by interconnecting oxygen and hydroxide ions, and 2) is or was part of a portion of clay.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clay#Properties"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


