        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that prevents the activation of neuroepithelial cell differentiation. Neuroepithelial cell differentiation is the process in which epiblast cells acquire specialized features of neuroepithelial cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>negative regulation of neural plate formation</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
