        <obo:IAO_0000115>The series of events in which a light stimulus (in the form of photons) is received and converted into a molecular signal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>detection of light</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>perception of light</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
