        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that decreases the frequency, rate or extent of cell communication. Cell communication is the process that mediates interactions between a cell and its surroundings. Encompasses interactions such as signaling or attachment between one cell and another cell, between a cell and an extracellular matrix, or between a cell and any other aspect of its environment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>negative regulation of cell communication</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
