        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that activates or increases the frequency, rate or extent of the regulated release of serotonin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>up regulation of serotonin secretion</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
