        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process aimed at the progression of a myotube cell over time, from initial commitment of the cell to a specific fate, to the fully functional differentiated cell. Myotubes are multinucleated cells that are formed when proliferating myoblasts exit the cell cycle, differentiate and fuse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>myotube cell development</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
