        <obo:IAO_0000115>The formation of the prechordal plate. The prechordal plate is a thickening of the endoderm at the cranial end of the primitive streak formed by the involution of Spemann&apos;s organizer cells. The prechordal plate and the notochord induce the formation of the neural plate from the overlying ectodermal cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
