        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032984"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which protein polymers, compounds composed of a large number of component monomers, are broken down. Depolymerization occurs by the successive removal of monomers from an existing poly- or oligomeric protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
