        <obo:IAO_0000115>A floral structure primordium (PO:0025477) that is committed to the development of a gynoecium (PO:0009062).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PO_GIT:465</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
