        <obo:IAO_0000115>The connective tissue located between the respiratory (airway and alveolar) epithelium, the capillary endothelium and pleural mesothelium; it contains basement membrane composed of collagen, elastin, proteoglycans, and fibronectin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000009>it functions in the mechanical behavior of the lung, and forms a barrier to regulate the flow of plasma constituents from the capillaries to the airway and alveolar spaces</obo:UBPROP_0000009>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/201609008"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:35521</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
