        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tube in the respiratory system. Examples: bronchus, bronchiole, trachea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>in GO lung development is part of respiratory tube development. This can lead to inconsistencies with other ontologies, e.g. VT. The GO structure may be better represented by a tree of tubes (see the FMA class)</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
