        <oboInOwl:source>DOI:10.1146/annurev.cellbio.22.010605.093317 Hartenstein V, Blood cells and blood cell development in the animal kingdom. Annual review of cell and developmental biology (2006) </oboInOwl:source>
    </owl:Axiom>
