        <obo:IAO_0000115>The subclavian artery that supplies the right pectoral appendage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>in humans, arises from the relatively short brachiocephalic artery (trunk) when it bifurcates into the subclavian and the right common carotid artery</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>proximal part arises from right 4th aortic arch in humans</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subclavian_artery"/>
