        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>The chamber of the heart that receives blood from the lungs[XAO:EJS].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000003>The tetrapod clade develops a complete atrial septum and loses the fifth aortic arch altogether.[well established][VHOG]</obo:UBPROP_0000003>
