        <obo:IAO_0000115>Sense organ embedded in the integument and consisting of one or a cluster of sensory neurons and associated sensory structures, support cells and glial cells forming a single organised unit with a largely bona-fide boundary.[FBbt].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>this term should be ceded to the arthropod anatomy ontology</obo:IAO_0000116>
