        <obo:IAO_0000115>Subdivision of skeleton that includes all dermal bones in the cranial skeleton[ZFA,modified].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>wikipedia treats skull roof and dermatocranium as synonymous, but some sources treat the roof as being part of the dermatocranium - see UBERONREF:0000007</obo:IAO_0000116>
