        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any of the striated muscles that move the eye and include: superior rectus, inferior rectus, medial rectus, lateral rectus, superior oblique, inferior oblique, retractor bulbi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Not clear if we need this and intra-ocular muscle. See issue #331. MA includes ciliary and iris smooth muscle</obo:IAO_0000116>
