        <obo:IAO_0000115>The His-Purkinje system receives signals from the AV node and is composed of the fibers that regulate cardiac muscle contraction in the ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>His-Purkinji network</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>VCS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ventricular conduction system</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:label>His-Purkinje system</rdfs:label>
