        <owl:annotatedTarget>An outgrowth on the lateral trunk of the embryo that develops into a limb or paired fin. The limb/fin bud is divided into ectoderm and mesenchyme[cjm, modified from MP].</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:9780878932504</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
