        <owl:annotatedTarget>note the distinction between intramembranous bone and intramembranous bone tissue. Some bones may be a mixture of both tissue types. The MA class most likely refers to a tissue type (it is under bone tissue and connective tissue; there are no child classes)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:external_ontology>MA</oboInOwl:external_ontology>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


