            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Skeletal subdivision that undergoes direct development and includes elements that either develop in association with the basement membrane of the ectoderm or are homologous with such elements; includes dermatocranium, components of the appendicular skeleton, teeth and tooth-like elements of the oropharynx, and integumentary elements.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>exoskeleton</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
