        <obo:IAO_0000115>A vein that is part of a abdomen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>TODO mirror representation of abdominal aorta</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>this class groups all veins that are in the abdomen. The term &apos;abdominal vein&apos; may have specific meanings in different contexts. The lateral abdominal veins are present in fishes but usually merged or absent in tetrapods; in amphibians, the L&amp;R abdominal veins merge into the ventral abdominal vein</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://www.snomedbrowser.com/Codes/Details/281473003"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:281473003</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
